WEBVTT

00:04:28.405 --> 00:04:32.048
"Oh, I hope you're not still hung up on
that conversation Mama had with you."

00:04:32.072 --> 00:04:33.074
(Laughter)

00:04:33.098 --> 00:04:34.879
I said, "What are you talking about?"

00:04:34.903 --> 00:04:38.056
He said, "Oh, Mama tells
all the grandkids that they're special."

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.202
(Laughter)

00:04:40.226 --> 00:04:42.726
I was devastated.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.638
(Laughter)

00:04:45.156 --> 00:04:47.095
And I'm going to admit something to you.

00:04:47.119 --> 00:04:49.662
I'm going to tell you something
I probably shouldn't.

00:04:49.686 --> 00:04:51.566
I know this might be broadcast broadly.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.768
But I'm 52 years old,

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:54.231
and I'm going to admit to you

00:04:54.255 --> 00:04:57.315
that I've never had a drop of alcohol.

00:04:57.339 --> 00:04:59.440
(Applause)

00:04:59.464 --> 00:05:02.108
I don't say that because
I think that's virtuous;